      <h1 class="article-title">The $840 Million Lawsuit That Was Undone by a PDF's Hidden Metadata</h1>
      <p class="article-subtitle">Four real cases where a file's invisible properties, not a witness, not an email, decided who was telling the truth.</p>
      <div class="article-tags">
        <span class="article-tag">Legal Evidence</span>
        <span class="article-tag">PDF Metadata</span>
        <span class="article-tag">Forensics</span>
        <span class="article-tag">Document Fraud</span>
